              "fixedCode": "async function fetchCount(): Promise<number> {\n  return 42;\n}\nfetchCount().then((n) => console.log(n));\n",
              "explanation": "Logging the promise itself prints the promise object, not its value; the value is only available after awaiting it or using .then."
